Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:15:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/48] feat(events): auto-promote waitlist when a seat frees
 (#471)

## Summary
On withdraw and capacity increase, freed seats are dealt to the head of
the waitlist inside the same transaction and event row lock, earliest
answer first. Previously a freed seat left the line unmoved and the
member had to claim it manually.

## Changes
- `EventService::promoteWaitlist()`: flips earliest waitlisted rows to
Going (up to freed seats), resets Discord mirror stamp; no-op on closed
events
- Wired into `withdrawRsvp()`, `update()`, and `updateForGrant()` under
the existing `lockForUpdate` discipline
- `RsvpButton` copy updated: the waitlist-claim control stays for the
gap a promotion cannot cover (mid-flight render)
- Regression tests: withdraw acceptance test (2-person line),
capacity-increase promotion, forced-interleave lock test (no sleeps)

## Testing
- `pest tests/Feature/WaitlistTest.php`: 19 tests, 45 assertions, all
pass (warnings are only the missing local `.env` notice)
- `pest tests/Feature/Events/`: 2 failures in `EventRelatedTest`,
verified pre-existing on the clean tree (sibling's related-events area)
- `pint`: clean on all four touched files

Refs: TOG-8394

