staging-only-in-prod, forbidden test seam, unknown key), each paired
with a leak-check assertion.
- `docs/env.md` §14: runbook for resolving each drift category (MISSING
/ PROD-HAS-STAGING-ONLY / FORBIDDEN / UNKNOWN).

