- `resources/views/join.blade.php` and
`resources/views/profiles/show.blade.php`: render a `route('discord')`
link (the database-free invite funnel) when `session('join_result') ===
'already_member'`, with a `reinvite-link` test id.
- `lang/en/join.php`: add the `reinvite` copy key.
- `tests/Feature/Join/AlreadyMemberReinviteTest.php`: pins the link on
`/join` for `already_member`, its absence for
`added`/`unavailable`/`expired`, and its presence on `/profile` after an
already-member one-click join.

## Testing

- `php vendor/bin/pint --test` — passed
- `php vendor/bin/phpstan analyse --memory-limit=512M` — no errors
- `php artisan view:cache` — Blade templates (including the new
conditionals) compile cleanly
- `php artisan test --filter=AlreadyMemberReinviteTest` — could not run:
this sandbox has no reachable Postgres (`docker-compose.yml` expects a
local Postgres container; no docker/postgres binary or root available
here to provide one), so no `RefreshDatabase`-based Feature test can
