`lang/en/join.php` keys (`added`, `already_member`, `unavailable`,
`expired` — no `denied`, which I removed from the test's `->with()` list
since `/join`'s `join_result` no longer flashes `denied`) and current
route/model names (`route('discord')`, `MemberStatsSource`,
`MemberStats::unavailable`). CI will run the full suite against real
Postgres.

