From: "togetherweown[bot]"
 <319968614+togetherweown[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:46:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/48] fix(a11y): visible focus ring and skip-link pill on
 light public pages (#462)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

## Summary

The vendored near-white focus ring is invisible on the light public
pages (1.05:1 on ledger paper against the 3:1 WCAG 2.4.13 floor). This
pass overrides it per light scheme with each scheme's own ink, makes the
revealed skip link an opaque pill, lands skip focus on #main, and labels
the events calendar scroll region.

## Changes

- resources/css/app.css: light-scheme :focus-visible override
(ledger/taste ink) + opaque skip-link pill; two.css untouched (vendored,
digest-pinned)
- resources/views/components/layouts/app.blade.php: tabindex=-1 on #main
so the skip link moves focus in Chrome/Safari
- resources/views/livewire/events-calendar.blade.php: role=region on the
calendar scroll region
- tests/Unit/SkipLinkFocusContractTest.php: 4 static pins (no DB)
- tests/Feature/SkipLinkFocusTest.php: skip link served on all six
public pages (needs Postgres)

## Testing

- Unit contract: 4 passed (11 assertions)
- VendoredTokens + DesignSystem guards: 7 passed (22 assertions) —
two.css byte-identical
- Vite build: green, new rules present in compiled app CSS (45.7 KB)
- Pint: passed; PHPStan binary present (no PHP changes to analyse)
- Served-page tests: not runnable here (no Postgres in sandbox); CI pest
job runs them. Static emulation of the same assertions: all green.
- Keyboard smoke: not run live (staging is behind Cloudflare Access, no
local DB); manual notes recorded on the card.

Refs: TOG-6932

