From: "togetherweown[bot]"
 <319968614+togetherweown[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:04:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/48] feat(featured): require alt text on featured images
 with title fallback (#474)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

## Summary

Featured images rendered with an empty alt attribute, so screen-reader
visitors got nothing. Audit (pinned by ImageUploadSurfaceTest, TOG-6946)
confirms events and profiles have no image/cover write surface at all —
featured images are the only in-scope gap.

## Changes

- Migration adds nullable featured_contents.image_alt beside the URL it
describes
- FeaturedContent::imageAltText(): written alt wins, else row title
(never empty when an image is present)
- Filament image_alt field with requiredWith('image_url') field error;
admin preview renders typed alt with title fallback while typing
- All render sites (home, taste + hallmark design-lab concepts) emit
imageAltText() instead of alt=""

## Testing

- php artisan test (4 scoped files) — 31 passed (126 assertions), run
against a byte-identical tree
- ./vendor/bin/pint --test on all touched PHP files — passed
- Audit: grep confirms no <img> in event views and no cover/image column
on events

Refs: TOG-8707

