Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:23:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/48] feat(prune): scheduled retention for join_attempts and
 idempotency keys (#476)

## Summary

join_attempts grows by one row per join attempt and
agent_event_idempotency_keys by one row per agent operation; neither had
a prune path. This adds MassPrunable scopes with configurable 90-day
retention on both, pruned by one daily model:prune schedule entry.

## Changes

