routes/console.php
- JOIN_ATTEMPT_RETENTION_DAYS and
AGENT_EVENTS_IDEMPOTENCY_RETENTION_DAYS in .env.example; retention
section in docs/env.md
- JoinFunnelStats docblock now says retention window instead of all-time
- Frozen-time feature test covering prune-keeps-fresh,
