private advisory first, minimal public issue fallback) plus scope,
72h/7d response SLA, coordinated disclosure, and supported-versions
notes. README gains a short ## Security section linking to it. Scoped
slice of TOG-8720 (byte-identical to 69376dd for these two files); does
not merge shared batch PR #470.

## Changes

- SECURITY.md (new): reporting channel, scope, response SLA, coordinated
disclosure, existing guards, supported versions
- README.md: ## Security section with link to SECURITY.md

## Testing

- Docs-only change; no test applies.
- Verified README.md and SECURITY.md byte-identical to source commit
69376dd for these paths.
- CI (incl. secret-scan, pr-lint) must be green on the head SHA before
merge.

Refs: TOG-8720

