## Summary

/design-lab/\* were registered unconditionally and rendered in every
environment including production. This gates them out of prod with the
repo's fail-closed pattern (same as the staging QA login):

- routes/web.php registers design-lab routes only outside production
- HallmarkController::__invoke and HomeController::taste abort 404 in
production (covers cached/manually-registered routes)

Verified the only route() self-reference lives inside the gated view
itself, so conditional registration breaks nothing in prod.

## Tests

- tests/Unit/DesignLabRouteRegistrationTest.php — not registered in
production; registered in local/staging/testing
- tests/Feature/DesignLabProdGatingTest.php — controllers 404 in
production even if the route is registered

33 tests pass across the new + existing design-lab/QA/image-optimization
suites.

Fixes TOG-5632.

