`expectedProductionRoutes()`, which still allowlisted them. Since
they're no longer registered, `array_diff($expected, $actual)` (the
"missing" check) is non-empty. The test's own comment named this exact
fix ("TOG-5632 removes these two lines when the design-lab gating
merges").
